      "descEn": "Backed by Mount Lu where Poyang Lake empties into the Yangtze River, Jiujiang (Chaisang / Xunyang / Jiangzhou) was Zhou Yu's naval base, Tao Yuanming's homeland, and the setting of Bai Juyi's Pipa Song."
