          "descZh": "192年在长安诛董卓，封温侯、与王允共秉朝政。丁原及董卓早年任官只留履历，不以封爵补造路线。 坐标为历史地点的区域近似；连线只表示经历先后，不复原古代道路。",
          "descEn": "In 192 he killed Dong Zhuo in Chang’an and shared government with Wang Yun. Earlier appointments and his marquisate do not supply additional travel locations. Coordinates approximate the historical area; lines show sequence rather than reconstructed ancient roads.",
