          "descEn": "Entered Kong Rong’s Duchang in present-day Shandong, broke out and obtained three thousand troops from Liu Bei at Pingyuan, then returned to relieve the siege. This merged stop must not be confused with Duchang in Jiangxi. Locations are approximate; connecting lines summarize sequence rather than ancient roads.",
          "quoteZh": "v049-b0011：時融以黃巾寇暴，出屯都昌，為賊管亥所圍。；v049-b0011：慈留三日，單步徑至都昌。；v049-b0011：明晨復出如此，無復起者，於是下鞭馬直突圍中馳去。；v049-b0011：遂到平原，說備曰；v049-b0011：即遣精兵三千人隨慈。賊聞兵至，解圍散走。",
