          "descEn": "Liu Zhang personally met Liu Bei at Fu with more than thirty thousand troops and supplied the proposed campaign against Zhang Lu. The location is historical Fu County at Mianyang, not Jiameng near Guangyuan. The meeting or banquet site is not identified. Coordinates approximate the historical locality; lines indicate sequence, not reconstructed ancient roads.",
          "quoteZh": "v032-b0016：至涪，璋自出迎，相見甚歡。；v031-b0010：璋率步騎三萬馀人，車乘帳幔，精光曜日，往就與會；v031-b0010：歡飲百馀日。璋資給先主，使討張魯，然後分別。",
