          "descEn": "The Biography of the Former Lord explicitly says Liu Zhang returned to Chengdu in the same year while Liu Bei went to Jiameng. This retains Liu Zhang’s outward and return journey without copying Liu Bei’s subsequent itinerary. Coordinates approximate the historical locality; lines indicate sequence, not reconstructed ancient roads.",
