          "descEn": "Liu Yan sent Zhang Lu and Zhang Xiu against Su Gu; Zhang Lu then killed Zhang Xiu and took his followers. The point represents Hanzhong and the basin of its historical seat Nanzheng, now in Hantai District, not the modern Nanzheng District seat. The exact battle sites and entry year are unrecorded; 193 is only a sorting year. Coordinates approximate the historical locality; lines indicate sequence, not reconstructed ancient roads.",
          "quoteZh": "v008-b0047：益州牧劉焉以魯為督義司馬，與別部司馬張脩將兵擊漢中太守蘇固；v008-b0047：魯遂襲脩殺之，奪其眾。；v008-b0047：魯遂據漢中，以鬼道教民，自號「師君」。；v031-b0005：故焉遣魯為督義司馬，住漢中，斷絕谷閣，殺害漢使。",
