          "titleEn": "Fled south into the Ba region after Yangping fell",
          "descZh": "本传写奔南山入巴中，先主传作遁走巴西；这里的巴中为巴地范围，不据同名把它精确到今巴中市。示意点选米仓山南麓、川东北巴地北部，只表达已由汉中南退，实际停驻县邑与过山路线未载。阳平关守将张卫另有其人，不为张鲁加守关站。 地点为历史地区的近似定位；连线表示先后，不复原古代道路。",
          "descEn": "The biography says Zhang Lu fled south through the mountains into the Ba region; Liu Bei’s biography calls it Baxi. This is a regional label, not proof of arrival in modern Bazhong city. The schematic point represents northern Ba south of the Micang Mountains; the exact stopping place and mountain route are unrecorded. Zhang Wei, not Zhang Lu, defended Yangping Pass. Coordinates approximate the historical locality; lines indicate sequence, not reconstructed ancient roads.",
