          "descEn": "Huang Quan’s biography explicitly records Zhang Lu’s return to Nanzheng before submission, while Cao Cao’s annals date the surrender of his remaining followers from Ba to November. This retains the return after his retreat. The exact surrender ceremony site is unrecorded; the point represents the attested return to Nanzheng. The Langzhong marquisate does not establish a journey to Langzhong. Coordinates approximate the historical locality; lines indicate sequence, not reconstructed ancient roads.",
